{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_014HeiBaiQmV6s6TWxCdsxmw","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Both acceptance criteria match expected output. Here's a summary of what was implemented:\n\n**R3.1 (`--field=FIELDS`)**: Field selection with comma-separated ranges (e.g., `2`, `1,3`, `2-5`, `2-`). Non-selected fields pass through unchanged. Whitespace-delimited fields preserve column alignment.\n\n**R3.2 (`--delimiter=DELIM` / `-d DELIM`)**: Custom field delimiter for `--field` processing. Without it, whitespace runs are used as delimiters.\n\n**R3.3 (`--header[=N]`)**: Passes through the first N lines (default 1) without conversion. Implemented via `os.Args` preprocessing to handle the optional-value GNU syntax.\n\n**R3.4 (`--to-unit=N` / `--from-unit=N`)**: Input scaling (multiply by `--from-unit`) and output scaling (divide by `--to-unit`) applied in the conversion pipeline.\n\n16 new differential test cases added covering all R3 features. All 57 tests pass against `gnumfmt`."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":175,"cache_read_input_tokens":71371,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":175},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"c21e2f76-afda-4939-b345-1cfc82a1e0dc","uuid":"69fa4c92-444d-4f60-831b-121c50b3b07c"}
